Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.55,0:04:32.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以看电影之前  我要过去找他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.19,0:04:34.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and make him try my bouillabaisse again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.19,0:04:34.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让他再尝尝我的马赛鱼汤
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:37.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't wait to read the front page of the Post tomorrow:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:37.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我等不及要看明天的邮报头版了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.51,0:04:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Restaurant reviewer admits: I was wrong about Monica."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.51,0:04:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"餐厅评鉴家承认  我错怪了莫妮卡"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:43.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The front page?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:43.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}头版
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:47.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You really do live in your own little world, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:47.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还真是坐井观天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:55.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you want these things delivered,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:55.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}需要我们提供送货服务吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.29,0:04:56.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. And Mrs. Geller?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.29,0:04:56.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}盖勒先生  盖勒太太
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:04:58.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Oh, no, no.  No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:04:58.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.71,0:05:01.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} We're not married.  We are having a baby together
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.71,0:05:01.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没有结婚  我们的孩子快出生了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:03.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but we're not involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:03.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们没有结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.35,0:05:08.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, we were seeing each other a while ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.35,0:05:08.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说我们曾经交往过...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:10.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but then we were just friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:10.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但后来我们成了朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:13.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and then there was one drunken night...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:13.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有天晚上我们喝醉了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:19.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or, yes, stranger, we'd like this delivered, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:19.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的  陌生人  我们需要送货服务
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:23.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Why don't you fill out this address card?  Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:23.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}麻烦你填一下住址  好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I notice you picked out a lot of dinosaurs items.  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我发现你们挑了不少恐龙  对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:29.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, that's one of the reasons why we're not a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:29.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实这也是我们没结婚的原因之一
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.05,0:05:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I chose those. I'm a paleontologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.05,0:05:33.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我挑的  我是古生物学家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:36.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? That is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:36.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  那太酷了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:38.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't get too worked up over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:38.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别因为这事兴奋过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.03,0:05:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It sounds like he's a doctor, but he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.03,0:05:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可能以为他是博士  但事实上不然
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:44.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I'm fascinated by paleontology.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:44.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我喜欢古生物学
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:46.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you read the Walter Alvarez book?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:46.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看过华特·艾瓦瑞兹的书吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:49.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. I teach it in my class.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:49.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我的教科书
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.11,0:05:51.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my god. Standing at a cash register,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.11,0:05:51.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  我站在收银台
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:53.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm holding a credit card, and I'm bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:53.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}手里拿着信用卡  快要无聊死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.11,0:05:57.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love your neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.11,0:05:57.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢你住的社区
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:05:59.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's a great gym right around the corner from your building.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:05:59.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}街角有家很棒的健身房
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.65,0:06:02.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} That's my gym.  I could tell you work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.65,0:06:02.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就在那里健身  我看得出来你有健身
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.65,0:06:11.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A paleontologist who works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.65,0:06:11.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一位喜欢健身的古生物学家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.13,0:06:13.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're like Indiana Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.13,0:06:13.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟印第安纳·琼斯一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:19.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am like Indiana Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:19.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我确实很像印第安纳·琼斯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:29.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Hi, Pheebs.  Hey! Oh, how did baby shopping go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:29.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨  菲比  宝宝的东西买得怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:32.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great! We got everything we needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:32.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了  我们需要的东西都买到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.59,0:06:35.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, and Ross almost got something that wasn't on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.59,0:06:35.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯差点拿到清单上没有的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.87,0:06:38.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.87,0:06:38.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个妓女
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:41.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:41.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.27,0:06:43.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were paying for our stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.27,0:06:43.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们正在付帐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:46.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and this sales woman just started flirting with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:46.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有个女销售员开始对他调情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:47.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:47.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能相信吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.94,0:06:51.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Did she know you two weren't married?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.94,0:06:51.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她知道你们没有结婚吗  知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:53.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:53.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:57.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, the idea... A woman flirting with a single man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:57.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个女人泡一个单身男人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.82,0:07:01.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} We must alert the church elders.  No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.82,0:07:01.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们得通知教会的长老  不
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:05.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't understand. You didn't see how brazen she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:05.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不了解  你没看到她多不要脸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Sounds like you're jealous.  No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好像在吃醋  我才没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:11.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just think it's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:11.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是觉得那是不对的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.18,0:07:13.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, here I am, about to pop...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.18,0:07:13.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说我就快生了...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.49,0:07:17.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and he's out picking up some shopgirl at SlutsRUs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.49,0:07:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而他却在荡妇专卖店泡女人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.98,0:07:20.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that a real place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.98,0:07:20.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的有那种地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:23.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are they hiring?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:23.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们在招人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.52,0:07:27.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Phoebe. Fatty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.52,0:07:27.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿  菲比  肥婆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.75,0:07:31.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler, why so fancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.75,0:07:31.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么那么高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I got a job interview. It's kinda a big deal too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得到一个面试机会  待遇很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.88,0:07:34.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a lot more money
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.88,0:07:34.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薪水比之前高很多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.58,0:07:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I'd be doing data reconfiguration and statistical factoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.58,0:07:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要做数据重构和统计保理工作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:39.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I know someone who does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:39.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认识一个人就是做那行的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.69,0:07:41.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me. I do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.69,0:07:41.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.89,0:07:45.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, seriously, do I look okay? I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.89,0:07:45.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看起来还好吧  我好紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.48,0:07:47.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. You really look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.48,0:07:47.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  你看起来棒极了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, just don't get your hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别抱太高希望
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.84,0:07:54.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Why not?  Well, the interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.84,0:07:54.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么  你要去面试
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:55.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What about it?  You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:55.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以呢  你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.98,0:07:58.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't make a very good first impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.98,0:07:58.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你给人留的第一印象都不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.80,0:08:02.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What?  Oh, you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.80,0:08:02.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  你不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:04.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:04.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.55,0:08:07.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, when I first met you, you were like:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.55,0:08:07.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我第一次见到你  你是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:10.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was like:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:10.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就想说...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:15.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is it that I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:15.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我做了什么让你不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.41,0:08:18.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just, like, you're trying too hard, always making jokes...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.41,0:08:18.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你太刻意想要讲笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:21.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You just come off a little needy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:21.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你显得太心急了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:24.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you like me when we first met?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:24.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们第一次见面时  你喜欢我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.22,0:08:27.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler, I'm not gonna lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.22,0:08:27.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒  我不想骗你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:29.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I am gonna run away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:29.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我要离你远点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.42,0:08:38.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. I'm Monica Geller, chef at Allessandro's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.42,0:08:38.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是莫妮卡·盖勒  亚利山多洛斯的主厨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:39.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Still?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:39.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在还是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.86,0:08:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think the things that you said about me are really unfair,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.86,0:08:42.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得你给我的评价很不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:46.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I would like for you to give my bouillabaisse another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:46.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想让你再尝尝我做的马赛鱼汤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:49.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't see why I'd do that to myself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:49.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我实在不明白自己为何要再尝一次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.65,0:08:51.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Either eat it or be in it.
