Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:43.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你嘴里全是吃的  我没听清你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.77,0:13:46.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Hats off to who now?  The chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.77,0:13:46.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟谁致意  主厨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:47.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:47.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:53.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think you'll find if I come to work here, I don't micromanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:53.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如有幸被录用  你会发现我不会事必躬亲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't shy away from delegating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不害怕把事情交给下属去做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:57.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:57.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很高兴知道这点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:14:00.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But let's stop focusing on what you don't do...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:14:00.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不要只谈那些你不会去做的事...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.01,0:14:02.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and focus on what you do do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.01,0:14:02.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们来谈谈你会去做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.19,0:14:07.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What I do do...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.19,0:14:07.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:14.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}is manage to create an atmosphere of support
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:14.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为我的下属们营造
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.23,0:14:15.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}for the people working with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.23,0:14:15.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一种团队互助的氛围
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:18.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see. Nice sidestep on the "do do" thing by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:18.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}了解  你很巧妙地避开了"会做"这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:20.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hardest thing I've ever done in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:20.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刚才是我人生中最漫长的三十秒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:22.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:22.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:25.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Don't worry. You're ready.  Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:25.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别担心  你准备好了  真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.35,0:14:28.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Absolutely! Just fight all your natural instincts,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.35,0:14:28.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然  千万不要跟着你的直觉走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:29.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and you'll be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:29.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会表现得很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:34.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica, my star student.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:34.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  我的明星学生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.47,0:14:35.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You called me that before,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.47,0:14:35.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你之前那么称呼过我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.94,0:14:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so I took the liberty and fashioned a star out of aluminium foil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.94,0:14:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我就擅作主张用铝箔纸做了一颗星星
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:41.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, no pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:41.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别觉得压力太大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:43.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you like my cookies, you give me the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:43.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你喜欢我的饼干  就奖我一颗星星
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, a star!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好耶  星星
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.31,0:14:55.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you all hate me, and I'm sorry, but I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.31,0:14:55.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你们都恨我  对不起  但我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.02,0:14:59.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Okay, Joey, you're up next.  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.02,0:14:59.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  乔伊  下一个是你  是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.68,0:15:05.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God! This is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.68,0:15:05.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  这简直太好吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.59,0:15:06.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You get an A.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.59,0:15:06.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我给你评"优"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.58,0:15:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got an A? In school? Hey, I'm a dork!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.58,0:15:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在学校里得到优  我也算是书呆子了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.74,0:15:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, I'm so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.74,0:15:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  我非常以你为荣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I think you should give him your star.  Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你该把你的星星给他  你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.78,0:15:22.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He doesn't know what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.78,0:15:22.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他都不知道自己在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:24.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're all beginners here. Nobody knows what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:24.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家都是初学者  没人知道自己在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.90,0:15:27.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do. I'm a professional chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.90,0:15:27.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道  我是职业主厨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:30.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, relax. It's not a courtroom drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少来了  这又不是法律戏剧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:32.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're a professional chef,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:32.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你是专业主厨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:34.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}why are you taking Introduction to Cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:34.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么要上初级烹调课
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.59,0:15:35.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.59,0:15:35.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.01,0:15:42.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. I cook at this restaurant, Allessandro's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.01,0:15:42.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  我是亚利山多洛斯餐厅的主厨...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.01,0:15:44.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I just got a really bad review.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.01,0:15:44.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚刚得到了差评
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:45.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Allessandro's?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:45.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亚利山多洛斯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.30,0:15:47.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I love that place!  You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.30,0:15:47.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢那个餐馆  是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, you're an excellent chef. As a person you're a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是个很棒的主厨  但你的个性有点...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:52.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'm totally crazy, but you liked the food?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:52.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是很疯狂  但你喜欢那里的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:54.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:54.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:59.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, then. I don't stink. I'm a good chef! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:59.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  那我还不赖  我是个好主厨  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:02.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't want to go. I'm having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:02.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想走  我玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:04.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, did either of you pay for this class?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:04.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们俩付学费了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.57,0:16:07.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, if my friend says it's time to go, it's time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.57,0:16:07.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我朋友说该走了  我们这就走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.21,0:16:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Also, I was the point person on my company's transition
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.21,0:16:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}另外  我还负责公司里KL5系统
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.88,0:16:22.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}from the KL5 to GR6 systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.88,0:16:22.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}转换到GR6系统的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:23.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You must have had your hands full.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:23.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定忙得不可开交
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:25.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That I did. That I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:25.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.18,0:16:29.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So let's talk a little bit about your duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.18,0:16:29.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们来谈谈你的职责吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.71,0:16:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My duties?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.71,0:16:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的职责
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:41.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:41.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.17,0:16:42.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll be heading a whole division,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.17,0:16:42.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你将负责一整个部门
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.96,0:16:44.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so you'll have a lot of duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.96,0:16:44.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你要担负起很多职责
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:52.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I see.  But there'll be 30 people under you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我了解  你手下会有30个人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.20,0:16:54.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so you can dump a certain amount on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.20,0:16:54.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以把很多工作分配给他们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:03.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Good to know.  We could go into detail...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:03.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那太好了  我们可以进一步详谈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, don't, I beg of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用了  我求你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.41,0:17:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. We'll have a definite answer for you on Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.41,0:17:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我们会在星期一回复你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.35,0:17:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I can say with some confidence, you'll fit in well here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.35,0:17:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我相信你能很好地融入公司环境
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.93,0:17:15.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Really?  Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.93,0:17:15.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  当然
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:20.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can relax. You did great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:20.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放轻松  你表现得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.21,0:17:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I gotta say thank you, I was really nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.21,0:17:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢  我刚才真的很紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.64,0:17:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm told I come on too strongly, too many jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.64,0:17:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家都说我太喜欢讲笑话缓和气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:28.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then it was really hard to sidestep that "duty" thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:28.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要避开"职责"的问题真的很难
