Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:46.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. This doesn't count. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:46.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  这不算数  好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.38,0:17:47.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The interview was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.38,0:17:47.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}面试已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.99,0:17:49.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was the real Chandler Bing in there.
